section.global-breadcrumb
	.container
		nav(aria-label="breadcrumbs", class="rank-math-breadcrumb")
			p
				a(href="#") Trang chủ
				span(class="separator")  | 
				span(class="last") Về chúng tôi
section.news-detail(class="section-py bg-Secondary-Light-Grey")
	.container 
		.wrapper(class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-base")
			.col-left(class="col-span-9 relative")
				.share-wrapper(class="xl:absolute top-0 -left-18 h-full xl:mt-0 mt-4")
					.share(class="sticky top-[8.3rem]")
						a(href="#" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-md hover:text-white hover:bg-Primary-1 bg-Black-100 text-Primary-Dark-green xl:border-2 border-2 border-Primary-1") 
							<i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i>
				h2(class="title-40 !text-Neutral-950") Hướng dẫn sử dụng thuốc bảo vệ thực vật an toàn và hiệu quả
				.info(class="flex items-center gap-3 my-5") 
					.cat(class="text-sm text-Primary-2 font-medium") Kỹ thuật trồng cây
					.line 
					.date(class="text-sm text-Neutral-600 font-medium") 03.06.2024
					.line
				.format-content 
					p Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Corporis odit, veniam eveniet expedita, amet, distinctio labore maxime fugit possimus voluptas libero dolore quas incidunt soluta. Voluptatum mollitia eum dignissimos provident!
					p Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Expedita voluptate quaerat dolor libero accusantium ipsum aut quo saepe iusto ea, pariatur placeat reprehenderit necessitatibus culpa laudantium ut adipisci! Eligendi, officia.
					.news-detail-info(class="bg-Neutral-White rounded-5 py-10 px-5")
						.info-top(class="flex items-center gap-4")
							.avatar(class="rem:max-w-[100px] w-full")
